WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,980
Yesterday the radio rang

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:04,580
Zhang Lei jumped out and pretended to be me

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:06,380
If I were the real Yuyan family

4
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,380
It's you

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,420
what would you do

6
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,540
I must choose to be a dog.

7
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,580
Great men will also pretend to be the Yuyan family

8
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:15,340
I don't know whether the person who jumped out is a human or a ghost.

9
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,440
But today Zhang Lei died

10
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:19,120
And you started to coax among yourself again

11
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,320
I have to stand up

12
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,160
You said you are from the Yuyan family, you are

13
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:26,360
How do I know if you are another fake?

14
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,520
very simple

15
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:33,220
I can tell you my test results

16
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,620
The person I checked on the first day

17
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,740
It's Zhang Lei

18
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:36,740
He is an ordinary person

19
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,040
No wonder it was after 12 o'clock the next day

20
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,200
Check and refresh

21
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,640
Zhang Lei has never dared to report the test results. Let me see.

22
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:47,040
Then Zhang Lei is a liar pretending to be the Yuyan family, right?

23
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:51,950
What about the next day?

24
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:54,180
The next day

25
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,580
I checked him
